    "faq": {
      "type": "home-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it legal?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Our non-infused blends are legal in all 50 states.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are functional mushrooms?",
            "answer": "<p>Functional mushrooms, like Lion's Mane or Cordyceps, are natural fungi used for their potential health benefits, such as supporting cognitive function and nerve health. We use fruiting bodies of Lion's Mane, the most potent part of the mushroom, and employ a unique process of concentration and micronization to make it stronger and fast-acting, ensuring most feel the effects quickly!</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do you ship?",
            "answer": "<p>We currently ship across the continental US - enter your shipping address in checkout to verify for your specific location.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does it feel like?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer uplifting, relaxing and social tonics depending on how you want to feel.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I get anxious or paranoid?",
            "answer": "<p>Highly unlikely— if you’re sensitive to caffeine we’d recommend our relaxing vs uplifting tonics. Most customers enjoy the balance of function and flavor. This formula is hemp-free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! All of our products have been third-party tested in registered facilities with GMP certifications. You can also find our lab certificates for each batch from the link in the footer.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_1",
        "question_2",
        "question_3",
        "question_4",
        "question_5",
        "question_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Functional mushrooms in a can",
        "background_image": "shopify://shop_images/pdp-faq-background.jpg",
        "margin_top": 40,
